#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:1
msgid "Agent admission policy"
msgstr "Agent 准入策略"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:3
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent decides who may use it from its own accounts. Each protected "
"owner or administration request, and `/v1/session/me`, reads the account "
"as it is now from this database, through the account directory "
"(`cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py`). Nothing is cached, and no other "
"service is asked. [Accounts and the waiting list](local-accounts.md) "
"describes how an account is created, approved and administered."
msgstr "Cloud Agent 依据自己的账号决定谁可以使用它。每个受保护的所有者或管理请求，以及 `/v1/session/me`，都通过账号目录（`cloud_agent/accounts/directory.py`）从本数据库读取账号的当前状态。不做任何缓存，也不询问任何其他服务。[账号与等候名单](local-accounts.md)说明账号如何创建、批准和管理。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:10
msgid "Permissions and request checks"
msgstr "权限与请求检查"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "Permission"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "Granted when"
msgstr "何时授予"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "Access"
msgstr "允许访问的范围"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "`agent.use`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "The account's waiting-list application is approved"
msgstr "账号的等候名单申请被批准"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "Owner APIs, subject to per-resource ownership checks"
msgstr "所有者 API，每个资源仍要单独检查所有权"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "`agent.admin`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "The account is approved and an administrator"
msgstr "账号已获批准并且是管理员"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "Administration, including runner-host APIs; requires `agent.use`"
msgstr "管理功能，包括 runner 主机 API；需要 `agent.use`"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An account that is unknown, unverified, suspended or deleted is refused "
"with `subject_unavailable`, which every caller treats as a denial. An "
"account that can sign in but holds no permission sees the waiting-list "
"page. Permissions must be unique, use recognized values and include "
"`agent.use` whenever `agent.admin` is present; a decision for another "
"account, or a malformed or contradictory one, cannot grant access. "
"Account roles and profile fields are not authorization inputs. The "
"session response exposes `agent_access: {allowed, permissions}`, and the "
"web app denies access if that field is missing."
msgstr "未知、未验证、已停用或已删除的账号会以 `subject_unavailable` 被拒绝，所有调用方都把它当作拒绝处理。能够登录但没有任何权限的账号会看到等候名单页面。权限必须唯一、使用可识别的取值，并且只要有 `agent.admin` 就必须同时有 `agent.use`；针对其他账号的决定，或格式错误、自相矛盾的决定，都不能授予访问权。账号角色和资料字段不是授权依据。会话响应提供 `agent_access: {allowed, permissions}`，缺少该字段时 Web 应用会拒绝访问。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:27
msgid ""
"Checks govern admission of each request. A permission withdrawn by an "
"administrator also stops the account's work (see [stopping an account's "
"work](local-accounts.md#stopping-an-accounts-work)). An owner stream (a "
"job's events, the account's change feed, a terminal's output) is admitted"
" when it opens and ends after about 15 minutes; the client reconnects "
"from where it left off and is admitted again, so a withdrawn permission "
"or an ended session stops a stream within that bound. An MCP OAuth "
"callback that returns after the account lost `agent.use` is refused "
"without consuming the authorization or exchanging its code."
msgstr "检查决定每个请求能否准入。管理员撤销某项权限时，也会停止该账号正在进行的工作（见[停止账号的工作](local-accounts.md#stopping-an-accounts-work)）。所有者的数据流（任务事件、账号的变更推送、终端输出）在打开时准入，大约 15 分钟后结束；客户端会从中断处重新连接并再次准入，因此被撤销的权限或已结束的会话最迟在这个时限内停止数据流。账号失去 `agent.use` 之后才返回的 MCP OAuth 回调会被拒绝，既不消耗该授权，也不交换其授权码。"

