msgid "HTTP 503; retry once the database recovers"
msgstr "HTTP 503；数据库恢复后重试"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid ""
"Missing account configuration (`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`, "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`) or a retired Gateway variable"
msgstr "缺少账号配置（`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`、`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`）或仍设置了已退役的 Gateway 变量"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md
msgid "The control plane does not start, and names what to set or remove"
msgstr "控制平面不启动，并指出需要设置或删除的项"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:47
msgid ""
"When `/me` cannot confirm current access, the web app hides protected "
"content and offers a retry without forcing another sign-in."
msgstr "当 `/me` 无法确认当前访问权时，Web 应用会隐藏受保护的内容，并提供重试，而不强制重新登录。"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:50
msgid "Infrastructure credentials"
msgstr "基础设施凭据"

#: ../developer/agent-access-policy.md:52
msgid ""
"`ADMIN_TOKEN` independently authorizes infrastructure administration and "
"the recovery settings page, even before any administrator account exists."
" Host/worker credentials, attempt lease fences and owner checks are "
"separate controls."
msgstr "`ADMIN_TOKEN` 独立授权基础设施管理和恢复设置页面，即使还没有任何管理员账号也是如此。主机/worker 凭据、attempt 租约栅栏和所有者检查是彼此独立的控制。"

